HADOUKEN's own code is released under the Zero-Clause BSD license (0BSD): no
attribution, no notice preservation, no conditions.

That covers main/, tools/, and components/audio_hal, display, imu, medal_input
and medalboot. Two things carry their own licences:

  * components/helix_mp3 is RealNetworks' libhelix-mp3 decoder, under the
    RealNetworks Public Source License (RPSL) - see the notices.
  * The JPEG decoder is the TinyJPEG (TJpgDec) in the ESP32-C6's ROM, by ChaN,
    used through ESP-IDF.

No video is included in this repository. The clip is yours to supply.

